# Testing standards

- Before claiming completion: run relevant automated checks and record evidence.
- Required suites when touching payments/security/catalog:
  - `node tests/master_system_verification.mjs`
  - `node tests/security_regression_suite.mjs`
- Pilot before scale: 100 representative books; ≥98% auto-assign precision before expanding.
- Unit focus: ISBN normalize, confidence score, SHA-256, image validation, path mapping.
- Data integrity: original IDs preserved; no broken downloads; no unauthorized cover overwrite.
- Never disable security scanners or weaken tests to make CI pass.
- Mark checklist items in `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_CHECKLIST.md` only with evidence.
